  m_text: 'Any runic symbol that lacks inherent power can be given power through mana. Mana can be imbued into these symbols and is stored in the infinite beyond among the stars. This mana can later be extracted from any similar rune from anywhere else, allowing for the flow of mana between pages and locations where it would normally be impossible to reach. Variable runes are ultimately a blank slate, able to take on properties held within mana. This allows them a great deal of flexibility and advanced uses that will be detailed in future chapters.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
